{"id":"ics-011","stemHtml":"<p>考虑下面的结构体：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">struct S {\n    char   c;\n    int    i;\n    char   d;\n    double x;\n    short  s;\n};\n</code></pre>\n<p>(1) 求各成员的偏移与 <code>sizeof(struct S)</code>。</p>\n<p>(2) 重排成员顺序，使 <code>sizeof(struct S)</code> 最小，写出新的定义与大小。</p>\n<p>(3) <code>struct S arr[4];</code> 中 <code>arr[2]</code> 相对 <code>arr</code> 的偏移是多少字节？</p>\n<p>(4) 在原来的 <code>struct S</code> 末尾再加一个 <code>char e;</code>，<code>sizeof(struct S)</code> 会变成多少？为什么？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>对齐三规则：成员偏移是自身对齐的倍数；结构体总大小是最大对齐的倍数；不满足时插填充。<code>double</code> 要 8 字节对齐，<code>int</code> 要 4，<code>short</code> 要 2，<code>char</code> 要 1。注意尾部填充，以及结构体数组的步长等于 <code>sizeof(struct)</code>。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> 最大对齐是 <code>double</code> 的 8，所以结构体总大小要是 8 的倍数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成员</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>对齐</th>\n<th>偏移</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>c</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i</code></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4（1–3 填充）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>d</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>x</code></td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>16（9–15 填充）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>s</code></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>24</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>成员占到偏移 25，结构体大小向上取到 8 的倍数：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">sizeof(struct</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">S)</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>32.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{sizeof(struct S)}=32.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">sizeof(struct S)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> 原则是「大的在前、小的在后」，让填充尽量少：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">struct T {\n    double x;  /* 0 */\n    int    i;  /* 8 */\n    short  s;  /* 12 */\n    char   c;  /* 14 */\n    char   d;  /* 15 */\n};\n</code></pre>\n<p>成员占 16 字节，正好是 8 的倍数，所以</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">sizeof(struct</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">T)</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{sizeof(struct T)}=16,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">sizeof(struct T)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>比原来省了一半。</p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> 数组元素之间按 <code>sizeof(struct S)</code> 等距排列，所以</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&amp;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&amp;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>32</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\&amp;arr[2]=\\&amp;arr[0]+2\\times32,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">&amp;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">&amp;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>即偏移 64 字节。注意这里是 <strong>32 而不是成员大小之和 26</strong>：填充也算进步长。</p>\n<p><strong>(4)</strong> <code>s</code> 占偏移 24–25，末尾追加的 <code>e</code> 放在偏移 26，需要 27 字节；向上取到 8 的倍数得</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">sizeof</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{sizeof}=32,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>不变</strong>。原来 <code>s</code> 后面就从 26 到 31 是尾部填充，正好把这个 <code>char</code> 塞进去。这说明「末尾加个小成员」不一定让结构体变大——这也是实际工程里用「末尾保留字段」做版本兼容的原因之一。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是按「1+4+1+8+2=16」直接给出 <code>sizeof</code>，忽略填充。二是重排时只把 <code>char</code> 挪到前面，忘了 <code>double</code> 必须在 8 的倍数偏移上，排出来的大小不是最优。三是把 <code>arr[2]</code> 的偏移算成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times26=52</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">52</span></span></span></span>，用了成员大小之和而不是 <code>sizeof</code>。四是第 (4) 问认为加了成员就一定要扩大 8 字节——尾部填充可能刚好容纳它。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>(1) 偏移 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0,4,8,16,24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">sizeof</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{sizeof}=32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6111em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span>；(2) 顺序 <code>double x; int i; short s; char c; char d;</code>，大小 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span>；(3) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span>；(4) 仍是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></p>\n"}